# l9-repo-template Global Agent Conventions

> This file is generated from .cursor/rules/templates/*.mdc.template. Do not edit directly; edit the template or plugin-config.yaml.

## Execution Discipline

- Read every target file completely before modifying.
- Produce complete files — no stubs, no TODO placeholders.
- Do not silently alter behavior. State the change and why.
- If scope touches protected paths, stop and ask for approval.

## Protected Paths

- `uv.lock`
- `pyproject.toml`
- `.l9/repo-workflow.json`
- `scripts/bootstrap_rename.py`
- `scripts/inventory_check.py`
- `scripts/repo_hygiene_audit.py`
- `Makefile`
- `Repo.mk`

## High-Risk Commands

- `git push --force`
- `rm -rf .venv`

## CI Gates

Run in this order:

- `make verify`
- `make check-config`
- `make check-rules`
- `make hygiene-check`

## Repo Cartridge

- Repo: `l9-repo-template`
- Domain: `l9-repo-birth-factory`
- Package: `l9_example_pkg`
- App entrypoint: `l9_example_pkg.app:app`
- Python: `3.12`
- Venv: `.venv/bin/python`
